      </p>

      <p>
        COBB Accessport
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>



  <div class="accordion-item">

    <button class="accordion-title">

      <span>
        Product information
      </span>

      <span class="accordion-icon">
        +
      </span>

    </button>


    <div class="accordion-content">

      <p>
        The BCP X500 FA20 Turbocharger is designed
        as a drop-in turbocharger for compatible
        WRX applications.
      </p>

